<title>USA: Progressive Q4 oper shr $1.18 vs $0.83.</title>
<headline>Progressive Q4 oper shr $1.18 vs $0.83.</headline>
<dateline>MAYFIELD VILLAGE, Ohio 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 1.23		   $ 0.86</p>
<p> Shr diluted	     $ 1.23		   $ 0.86</p>
<p> Net			 91,700		   66,500</p>
<p> Revs		     937,500		  782,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	71,500		   72,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	71,500		   72,100</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 4.14		  $  3.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$4.11		  $  3.24</p>
<p> Net			313,700		  250,500</p>
<p> Revs		   3,478,400		3,011,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	71,600		   71,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	74,800		   74,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The Progressive Corp reported fourth quarter 1996 operating income of $87.9 million, or $1.18 a share, against operating income of $64 million, or $0.83 for the same period the year before. Net income results for the quarter include net realized gains on security sales of $5.9 million, of $0.05 a share, compared with $3.9 million, or #0.03 a share, in the previous year.</p>
<p>Periods ended Dec 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
